Actually, the key scenario for double-counting: on a machine PR with ai_validating label, fail-validation handles the red: reports + records 🔴 marker (red N/cap) + requeues agent:rework on the linked ISSUE. Then rework-on-red-ci (issue carrier) dispatches. When the rework leg pushes a fix, new head; validation re-runs. If red again on new head, fail-validation records red 1/2... on the new head — separate budget.

